    "title": "[Parallax | Customizable] No Game No Life: Zero",
    "description": "Artist: https://www.pixiv.net/users/6781311\r\nSong: Konomi Suzuki - THERE IS A REASON\r\nPiano arrangement by Animenz\r\nModified from: https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=1326866242\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\nAdded more settings\r\nAdded parallax effect\r\nAdded more dynamic effects\r\nAdded audio response and audio visualization (settable)\r\nMore types of particles (settable)\r\nAdd an optional pure piano version of the song\r\n\r\nRegarding performance issues.\r\nThe number of particles around the pieces is 25k according to the original author's settings.\r\nIf you feel that the number is too much and too stuck, you can adjust down the \"Amount of particle\" in the settings, and at the same time, you can choose to adjust up the \"Particle size\" slightly in order to prevent the particles from getting too sparse due to the downward adjustment of the number of particles.\r\n\r\nChangelog from 2022:\r\nJanuary 21\r\nAdded depth parallax effect.\r\nAdded highlight effect.\r\n\r\nJanuary 22\r\nFine-tuned several hair flutter effects.\r\nExpanded hair parallax area to improve artifacts.\r\nFine-tuned coordinates and parallax depth for audio visualization.\r\nFixed the inconsistency in the parallax depth calculation script of the 2 halos.\r\n\r\nJanuary 23\r\nAdded \"Show advanced settings\" checkbox.\r\nAdded 2 advanced settings for audio visualization.\r\nChanged setting name format in wallpaper settings.\r\nFixed a syntax issue in property calculation scripts.\r\n\r\nFebruary 8\r\nFixed several bugs in the script.\r\nFixed an issue with the upper bar bounds setting in the audio visualization.\r\n\r\nMarch 12\r\nFixed clock position not changing when adjusting the clock horizontal position setting\r\n\r\nJune 28\r\nAdded Chess twirl effect",
